    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79546" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰρήϊον</span></b> , τό (
			Ion.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεῖον</span>, which is not in
		use), used in <i><span class="en">
			Il.
		</span></i> as the sg. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρειά</span> (which <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> uses only in pl.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cheek</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.690
			</span></i> ; of the <i>jaw</i> of a wolf, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσιν δὲ π. αἵματι φοινόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.159
				</span></i>
			 : in pl., of a lion, 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρήϊά τ᾽ ἀμφοτέρωθεν αἱματόεντα
					πέλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.404
				</span></i>
			 ; in 
				Ion.
			 Prose, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λουσαμένους
			παρήϊα</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				593.30
			</span></i> (Ceos, V B.C.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἔμμεναι ἵππων</span>
			<i>cheek-ornament</i> of a bridle, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.142
			</span></i>.</div>
